                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28fb9756-e9ba-4e0b-86c6-ea595a7149b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b0605e09-7935-3f73-8117-5f20d3c82da0",
                                                "text": "...and she was just in time to see Mr. Boyne Sillery hand her aunt into a carriage, jump in himself, when it drove off with a rapidity which scarcely allowed her to observe that a large imperial was on the top, and her aunt's servant, with a huge bandbox, on the dickey."
                                            }
