                                                "sense_id": "ad88c5e8-d017-3c85-87c9-6ff02b14698b",
                                                "text": "I've heard grandfather say that when Mr. Priest was at his best there was scores o' young gents as used to come to school as day-boys, 'cause there was no room for 'em to board; and they used to come on dickies […]"
